- account ||= @current_account

div class="row justify-content-center mt-4"
  div class="col-md-8 col-lg-7"
    a href="/account/#{account['username']}" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mb-3" Back to profile

    div class="card shadow-sm"
      div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5"
        p class="text-uppercase text-primary fw-semibold mb-2" Account
        h1 class="h3 mb-4" Edit profile

        form method="post" action="/account/#{account['username']}/edit"
          input type="hidden" name="_method" value="patch"

          div class="mb-3"
            label.form-label for="input-account-username" Username
            input#input-account-username.form-control type="text" name="username" value=account['username'] required="required"

          div class="mb-3"
            label.form-label for="input-account-email" Email
            input#input-account-email.form-control type="email" name="email" value=account['email'] required="required"

          hr.my-4

          p class="text-muted small mb-3" Leave the password fields blank if you only want to update your username or email.

          div class="mb-3"
            label.form-label for="input-account-password" New password
            input#input-account-password.form-control type="password" name="password" minlength="8" placeholder="New password"

          div class="mb-3"
            label.form-label for="input-account-password-confirm" Confirm new password
            input#input-account-password-confirm.form-control type="password" name="password_confirm" minlength="8" placeholder="Confirm new password"

          div class="mb-4"
            label.form-label for="input-account-current-password" Current password
            input#input-account-current-password.form-control type="password" name="current_password" placeholder="Required when changing your password"
            div class="form-text" Enter your current password only if you are changing your password.

          button.btn.btn-primary.btn-lg.w-100 type="submit" Save changes
